<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALO ALTO, Calif., Nov 18 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.62		    $0.64</p>
<p> Net		 648,000		  678,000</p>
<p> Revs		10,147,000	     9,048,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  1,047,000		1,054,000</p>
<p>			    Year</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.46		    $2.31</p>
<p> Net		 2,586,000		2,433,000</p>
<p> Revs		38,420,000	     31,519,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  1,052,000		1,052,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Average number of shares has been restated to reflect the retroactive effect of the July 1996 two-for-one stock split.  </p>
<p>Latest Q4 net compares with First Call consensus estimate of $0.64 per share.</p>
</text>
